  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="n0abc1605ede544e1ab8c45503b83a543b640">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#Imp"/>
    <rdfs:label>MQI_SM_Damage</rdfs:label>
    <ns3:isRuleEnabled rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ns3:isRuleEnabled>
    <rdfs:comment>If a wall has a representative volume element which has a pattern which has dominant pattern entities (units) that have a damaged area then the value of MQI Unit Properties is equal to ‘0.3’ for vertical loads, ‘0.5’ for out of plane loads and ‘0.3’ for in plane loads.</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:body rdf:nodeID="n0abc1605ede544e1ab8c45503b83a543b646"/>
    <ns1:head rdf:nodeID="n0abc1605ede544e1ab8c45503b83a543b651"/>
