    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Shear Strength (Mohr Coulomb)</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Average shear strength according to the Mohr-Coulomb criterion. It is used in the case of regular-textured masonry and corresponds to diagonal tensile failure at the joints level.</rdfs:comment>
