    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Shear Strength (Turnsek and Cacovic)</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Average shear strength according to the Turnsek and Cacovic criterion. It is used in the case of irregular-textured masonry and corresponds to diagonal tensile failure at the masonry level.</rdfs:comment>
