    <ns3:isRuleEnabled rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ns3:isRuleEnabled>
    <rdfs:comment>If a wall has a representative volume element which has a pattern which has dominant pattern entities that are ‘squared hardstone’ units, then the value of MQI Unit Properties is equal to ‘1’ for vertical loads, ‘1’ for out of plane loads and ‘1’ for in plane loads.</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:body rdf:nodeID="n0abc1605ede544e1ab8c45503b83a543b914"/>
    <ns1:head rdf:nodeID="n0abc1605ede544e1ab8c45503b83a543b918"/>
