    <rdfs:comment>If a wall has a representative volume element which has a pattern which has a homogeneous pattern entity that are ‘vertically aligned units’, then the value of MQI vertical joints is equal to ‘0’ for vertical loads, ‘0’ for out of plane loads and ‘0’ for in plane loads.</rdfs:comment>
    <ns1:body rdf:nodeID="n0abc1605ede544e1ab8c45503b83a543b970"/>
